in="40.327" end="40.704">单</span><span begin="40.704" end="40.987">车</span><span begin="40.987" end="41.938">的我</span><span begin="41.938" end="43.033">俩</span></p><p begin="43.611" end="45.694" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.611" end="44.001">怀</span><span begin="44.001" end="44.851">紧贴背的</span><span begin="44.851" end="45.287">拥</span><span begin="45.287" end="45.694">抱</span></p></div><div begin="45.756" end="1:17.352" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.756" end="49.287" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.756" end="46.268">难</span><span begin="46.268" end="46.514">离</span><span begin="46.514" end="47.616">难舍</span><span begin="47.616" end="48.098">想</span><span begin="48.098" end="48.344">抱</span><span begin="48.344" end="49.287">紧些</span></p><p begin="49.478" end="52.980" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.478" end="49.960">茫</span><span begin="49.960" end="50.209">茫</span><span begin="50.209" end="51.362">人生</span><span begin="51.362" end="51.780">好</span><span begin="51.780" end="51.980">像</span><span begin="51.980" end="52.980">荒野</span></p><p begin="53.181" end="56.589" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.181" end="53.531">如</span><span begin="53.531" end="54.380">孩儿能</span><span begin="54.380" end="55.036">伏于</span><span begin="55.036" end="55.703">爸爸</span><span begin="55.703" end="55.953">的</span><span begin="55.953" end="56.188">肩</span><span begin="56.188" end="56.589">膊</span></p><p begin="56.791" end="1:00.216" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.791" end="58.710">谁要</span><span begin="58.710" end="59.545">下</span><span begin="59.545" end="1:00.216">车</span></p><p begin="1:00.508" end="1:04.052" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.508" end="1:01.051">难</span><span begin="1:01.051" end="1:01.283">离</span><span begin="1:01.283" end="1:02.435">难舍</span><span begin="1:02.435" end="1:02.885">总</span><span begin="1:02.885" end="1:03.103">有</span><span begin="1:03.103" end="1:0